# App-authored transition, not from a tape. No tape or manual in the library
# reaches Focus 49. The only descriptive footing is the public I-There-cluster
# label and an unverified secondary overview; this body labels that footing and
# prescribes neither distance, structure nor company.

@segment    climb-f42-f49
@title      Climb — Focus 42 to Focus 49
@levels     F49
@from       F42
@fixed
@verbosity  3
@protected  Focus 49, I-There, Cluster Council
@duration   ~1m35s

say From Focus 42, you will move through the count to Focus 49.
pause 4
say The available secondary map associates Focus 49 with exploration beyond our galaxy, I-There clusters, and what it calls the Cluster Council. No tape or manual here establishes what this movement should feel or look like.
pause 7
say Carry those as coordinates, not requirements. Let the numbers mark the movement, and observe what is actually present, including any absence.
pause 6
level F49
say Forty-two.
pause 5
say Forty-three.
pause 5
say Forty-four.
pause 5
say Forty-five.
pause 5
say Forty-six.
pause 5
say Forty-seven.
pause 5
say Forty-eight.
pause 5
say Forty-nine.
pause 4
say Focus 49. I-There. Cluster Council.
pause 8
